# V2 build output (rebuilt from source with pnpm build).
# v2/dist/ files MUST be committed so the delegation bridge can find
# them without requiring a build step in the consumer's checkout.
# The build script (see v2/package.json) produces:
#   - v2/dist/entry/pr-review.js + pr-content.js (entry bundles)
#   - v2/dist/cli.js/ (transitive dep, ncc output is a directory)
#   - v2/dist/adapter/, context/, etc. (transitive dep directories)
#
# The previous approach of using !v2/dist/cli.js (a single file) was
# broken because ncc bundles into a directory, not a file. Whitelisting
# the whole v2/dist/ tree is simpler and matches the actual build shape.
!v2/dist/
v2/coverage/